WEBVTT

00:04:56.038 --> 00:05:00.704
in short-term evolutions,
such as medical or meteorological,

00:05:00.746 --> 00:05:02.371
or in predictive situations,

00:05:02.413 --> 00:05:05.704
such as business, crime,
or disease trends.

00:05:06.788 --> 00:05:10.204
Virtually every field is turning
to gathering big data,

00:05:10.246 --> 00:05:13.038
with mobile sensor networks
spanning the globe,

00:05:13.079 --> 00:05:15.371
cameras on the ground and in the air,

00:05:15.413 --> 00:05:18.538
archives storing information
published on the web,

00:05:18.579 --> 00:05:23.371
and loggers capturing the activities
of internet citizens the world over.

00:05:23.496 --> 00:05:26.038
The challenge is on to invent
new tools and techniques

00:05:26.079 --> 00:05:27.913
to mine these vast stores,

00:05:27.954 --> 00:05:31.913
to inform decision making,
to improve medical diagnosis,